{"data":{"body":"[P2] Remove the zero-event requirement from both case-25 views. OpenTelemetry permits SDK instrumentation to record a real exception escaping this failed callback span; an empty service error payload does not prove no language-level exception occurred. Keep the `ERROR` status assertion, but remove `exception_event_count: 0` here and from `otel-invocation-25`, or validate only attributes that would indicate fabricated service details.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABAjHGKQ","finding_digest":"e842bbb16b1c4f62f714d395462fb3ab97f9cc07c57ead0717654a5014a33471","finding_id":"arf_v1_5bblxmlldrhwf5yu2okuml5tvo","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-execution/otel-execution-25.yaml::failed-callback-expectation::exception-event-optionality","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-execution/otel-execution-25.yaml::failed-callback-expectation::exception-event-optionality","line":246,"observation_digest":"3282d836ea57573bbe6e7bc7947124f24a76e8ce8edaf8f6cf04bac0c55141a5","observation_id":"aro_v1_gkbnqnxkk5ltxptoppdzi4je6j","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-execution/otel-execution-25.yaml","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_5bblxmlldrhwf5yu2okuml5tvo","published_at":"2026-10-21T00:30:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_zndguhvt465ciag5enhlkflsyr","reviewed_base_sha":"37656dd6f43d565d8e90e22f3554faa7c92dcb01","reviewed_head_sha":"349fdd495f3c371c685517071b5e12d55f897a08","reviewer":"codex","start_line":246,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_7yvxpml5c2nrn3bn6bdsxzp42u","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-21T00:30:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
